;; The Lucide icons the interface uses (ADR-0026). `bb design:icons` copies each one from the
;; lucide-static package (ISC; the icons derived from Feather are MIT) into libs/ui/src/pulse/ui/icons.cljc
;; as Clojure data, so that no page asks for an icon font or a file at run time and the stack starts without
;; Node. To use another icon, add its name here (the file names of lucide.dev) and run the task again.
